      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know you say that but i really dont have the time to go to the er right now... work is crazy. i've been taking some ibuprofen to help with the leg pain and it seems okay. do u really think i need a doctor for this or could it just be stress/anxiety? i've had chest tightness before when i'm overwhelmed.",
