      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overthinking it. the chest thing comes and goes. if i just take another dose of ibuprofen and maybe some ashwagandha for the stress, do u think that would be enough to manage it until the weekend? i really just want to avoid a huge hospital bill if i can just settle it myself at home.",
